Date: Fri, 7 Nov 2025 07:12:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Add ImageGrid component for multiple images support

- Created ImageGrid.tsx component with support for 1/2/3/4+ images
- Added getBookmarkLinkImages() function to get all banner images
- Modified LinkCard.tsx to use ImageGrid for multiple images
- Implemented responsive layouts:
  * 1 image: full-width
  * 2 images: two columns
  * 3 images: 2 on top, 1 on bottom
  * 4+ images: 2x2 grid with 'Show N more' button
- Added lightbox (Dialog) for fullscreen image viewing
- Backward compatible with existing single image bookmarks
